13. Important Notes for Your Current Project
Because your latest completed steps already include wallet creation, wallet login, wallet-to-wallet transfer, organization transaction, and wallet query APIs, this Step 26 should primarily read from:
blockchain.blockchain_transaction
PostgreSQL is the recommended default source for transaction history because it supports:
Fast paginationCOUNT(*)Stable sortingDashboard searchReportingAudit/history APIsIntegration with Angular/Spring Boot
Fabric/CouchDB should be used when you want to verify blockchain state directly:
